",[85],{"_51":86,"_25":87},"Tripo task results","https://docs.tripo3d.ai/task-query/get-your-task-result.html","Project source",[90],{"_51":88,"_25":57},"Why it belongs here","H3 text-to-model requests (v3.1-20260211 and v3.0-20250812) expose separate geometry and texture seeds plus PBR controls. Persist model_version and task ID, query with the submitting API key, and download successful output files promptly: their URLs expire after five minutes by default. Low-poly generation can fail on complex inputs. Cross-version reproducibility, output rights, cancellation endpoints and retry charges remain unverified.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","3D development","category","lead","summary","name","3d","tool",[110],[82],[109],[103],"assets",{"_51":86,"_25":87},{"_112":113},"documents",{"_114":115,"_116":117},"en",[119,123,124,125,122,126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,121,158,120,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176],"zh",[118,119,120,121,122],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","med